# TASK-260728-3a2dnr — results (rework round 2)

Rework after the independent review of 2026-07-28 returned **CHANGES REQUESTED**
with 8 required items. This document answers each item with the exact change and
its evidence. No tunnel product code was written; `Sources`, `Tests`, `Protocol`,
`relay`, `scripts`, `config`, `Package.swift`, and `Makefile` are untouched.

The reviewer's framing was correct: mechanical board validity was green while the
plan would have started prohibited NIOSSH work, hit undeclared human decisions,
and eventually demanded deferred iPhone evidence.

