LOGBOOK.md:563:- BLOCKER: The neutral network seam injects an `SSHTCPConnection` with readiness/read/write/close only, while `NIOSSHHandler` can run only inside a NIO `Channel`. The seam exposes neither a transferable connected socket nor an engine-bootstrap capability. Opening a second socket ignores injection; adapter-private downcast breaks fake replaceability; a socketpair pump is a forced-fit extra transport.
LOGBOOK.md:566:- ROUTING: Recommend an accepted candidate-neutral connected-socket/engine-bootstrap seam plus ReluxNIOSSH consumer-driven receive-credit and maximum-packet/intake hooks, each with deterministic tests. Exact evidence, rejected workarounds, alternatives, and resume condition are attached as `TASK-260715-1af33i_adapter-api-blocker.md`.
